[statement]
A package replaced does not hold up the removal of a package that provided
a name it needed, where another package provides that name now: `q` is
removed first, and `r` provides `v` to `kk` 2.

[repository]
P:r
V:1
p:v=2

P:zz
V:1

P:kk
V:2
D:v>=2

[installed]
P:q
V:1
p:v=1

P:kk
V:1
D:v

[world]
kk

[request]
kk>=2
zz

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove q 1
install r 1
upgrade kk 1 2
install zz 1
